      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This system could be used for uploading numerous camera enhancementsm we already have vrclens, but a full camera animation system to set up keyframe objects for the camera to smooth between could act almost exactly like the Camera Animations mod, which is something I've been craving ever since EAC",
